---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/pages/PageHero.astro';
import { links } from '../data/links';
const roles=[['Report','Back an answer with a REP bond. If no one challenges it, it becomes final.'],['Challenge','Disagree by posting a larger bond. If your answer holds, you win most of the losing bond.'],['Fork','If a dispute reaches a fork, holders can move their REP to the universe they believe reflects reality.']];
const versions=[['REPv1','Legacy token from the original Augur.','Legacy'],['REPv2','The Augur v2 token in the parent universe.','Parent universe'],['REPv2_Yes_1','The winning side of the 2026 Moon Fork. Augur Lituus is being built around it.','Current reference'],['REPv2_No_1','The other side of the Moon Fork, a separate live universe.','Separate universe']];
const forkSteps=[['A dispute reaches the fork','Challenges keep doubling the bond until it crosses the fork threshold.'],['The universe splits','One child universe is created for each possible answer, each with its own REP.'],['Holders choose a side','REP migration into an outcome universe is one-way. Each design sets its own migration rules.']];
import Icon from '../components/primitives/Icon.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="REP | Augur’s token" description="How REP secures Augur’s oracle, the REP versions, and what a fork means. Reporting and challenging are optional.">
 <PageHero title="REP" lead="REP (Reputation) secures Augur’s oracle. Reporting and challenging are optional: participants put a REP bond at risk behind an answer. A fork is the last resort." />
 <section class="section container ruled"><div class="section-heading"><h2>What REP does</h2><p class="lead">Trading a prediction isn’t the same as reporting its outcome. REP is for reporting, challenging and, as a last resort, choosing a side in a fork.</p></div><div class="roles">{roles.map(([title,body])=><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></div>)}</div><div class="holder-note"><h3>If you hold REP, here’s what to watch</h3><p>REP belongs to a particular protocol and universe. During a fork, each design has its own migration rules and window. Reporting and challenging remain optional; holding REP alone does not earn reporting rewards.</p><p>Under the proposed Augur Lituus rules, winners receive 80% of losing bonds and 20% is burned. <a href={links.whitepaper.url}>Whitepaper §4.3.1 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></div></section>
 <section class="section container ruled"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Which REP do you hold?</h2><p class="lead">A ticker alone doesn’t identify the token. The version and contract address identify which REP it is.</p></div><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="REP versions"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Version</th><th scope="col">What it is</th><th scope="col">Chain</th><th scope="col">Contract</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{versions.map(([version,description,status])=><tr><th scope="row">{version}</th><td>{description}</td><td>Ethereum</td><td>Not yet verified</td><td><span class:list={['version-status',{current:status==='Current reference'}]}>{status}</span></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p class="table-note">Contract addresses and explorer links appear here once verified.</p></section>
 <section class="section container ruled"><div class="section-heading"><h2>During a fork</h2><p class="lead">A fork only happens when a dispute escalates all the way. Here’s what holders need to know.</p></div><ol class="fork-steps">{forkSteps.map(([title,body],index)=><li class="tile"><span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">{index+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></li>)}</ol><p class="fork-note">Augur v2’s completed fork, Augur Lituus’s proposed rules and Zoltar’s model differ in their details. Each guide states which one it describes.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button outline" href={links.moonFork.url}>Read the Moon Fork report<Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a><a class="button text" href={links.discord.url}>Ask a question on Discord<Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div></section>
</PageLayout>
<style>
 .ruled{border-top:1px solid var(--border-quiet);padding-top:72px}.ruled .section-heading{margin-bottom:48px}.roles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:48px}.roles{border-top:1px solid var(--border-quiet)}.roles>div{padding-top:40px}.roles>div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--border-quiet);padding-left:32px}.roles h3::before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--primary);margin-right:12px;vertical-align:middle}.roles p,.fork-steps p{font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:var(--muted-foreground);margin-top:14px}.holder-note{padding:32px 36px;margin-top:48px;border:1px solid var(--primary);background:var(--web-quiet)}.holder-note p{color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:18px;line-height:28px;margin-top:16px}.table-scroll{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:780px}th,td{text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-quiet);padding:24px;font-size:17px;line-height:26px}thead{background:var(--web-quiet)}thead th{font:400 13px/18px var(--font-heading);color:var(--muted-foreground)}tbody th{font:600 18px/26px var(--font-heading);width:22%;white-space:nowrap}td:nth-child(2){width:28%;color:var(--muted-foreground)}td:nth-child(3){white-space:nowrap}td:nth-child(4){color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:15px}.version-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--web-outline);font-size:13px;line-height:18px;padding:6px 10px;white-space:nowrap}.version-status.current{border-color:var(--primary)}.version-status.current::before{content:'';width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--primary)}.table-note{font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:var(--muted-foreground);margin-top:40px}.fork-steps{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.fork-steps li{padding:28px}.step-number{display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-foreground);font:600 15px/22px var(--font-heading)}.fork-steps h3{font-size:22px;line-height:30px;margin-top:24px}.fork-note{font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:var(--muted-foreground);max-width:900px;margin-top:32px}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;margin-top:32px}@media(max-width:1023px){.roles,.fork-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.roles{border-top:1px solid var(--border-quiet)}.roles>div{padding-top:40px}.roles>div+div{padding:24px 0 0;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-quiet)}.holder-note{padding:24px}}@media print{.table-scroll{overflow:visible}table{min-width:0}}
</style>
